; Buttons that name a type variation the default theme defines (default_theme.cpp:357-375, :394-401).
; FlatButton and FlatMenuButton draw an empty box with Button's margins, and pressed a darker box. A Button
; on a Label variation reads Label's empty `normal`, so it keeps no margins, but Button's own `pressed`
; and `disabled`. The Labels beside them pin the font steps the Buttons share.

